    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O’Farrell Property is delighted to present this turn-key 3 bedroom / 3 bathroom semi-detached home, ideally positioned within the highly regarded Highfield Manor development.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent condition, this impressive home has been extensively upgraded, with no expense spared in creating a stylish, high-quality and exceptionally comfortable home.\r\n\r\nBuilt in c. 2006 and extending to c. 115m², the accommodation comprises a bright entrance hallway, spacious living room with bay window and feature marble fireplace, leading through double doors to the impressive kitchen/dining room. The bespoke fitted kitchen is finished with granite worktops and provides excellent space for both everyday living and entertaining. Patio doors open onto the generous rear garden and beautiful paved patio area, which enjoys excellent sunshine. Completing the ground floor is a utility room and recently renovated guest WC with a stylish wall hung vanity unit.\r\n\r\nUpstairs are three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a particularly spacious primary bedroom with bespoke solid wardrobes and a recently upgraded en-suite featuring a large walk-in shower and a wall hung vanity unit. The main bathroom has also been upgraded to an excellent standard, with an extra-large walk-in shower, a wall hung vanity unit and full tiling.\r\n\r\nThe property has also benefited from a recently upgraded heating system, including a new Baxi boiler and radiators and boasts a B3 energy rating.\r\n\r\nFurther features include:\r\n•\tBespoke fitted kitchen with granite worktops\r\n•\tBespoke solid wardrobes in the principal bedrooms\r\n•\tFitted wardrobes in all bedrooms\r\n•\tRecently upgraded main bathroom, en-suite and guest WC\r\n•\tNew Baxi boiler and radiators\r\n•\t9ft ceilings throughout the ground floor\r\n•\tBurglar alarm\r\n•\tExtended driveway with ample off-street parking\r\n•\tSecure side entrance\r\n•\tPrivate rear garden with attractive patio area and mature planting\r\n\r\nExternally, the property enjoys a superb position on a quiet cul-de-sac with no passing traffic, overlooking a large green recreational area. The generous rear garden provides a wonderful private space for relaxing and entertaining.\r\nHighfield Manor is a popular family-oriented development located at the foot of the Killeshin Hills, with extensive green areas and an attractive tree-lined avenue.\r\n\r\nThis property has never been rented and is a chain free sale.\r\n\r\nHallway\r\nTiled flooring, alarm pad, under stairs storage, coving\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\nFeature marble fireplace with Stanly stove, timber flooring, coving, double doors to kitchen / dining room, bay window \r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room\r\nBespoke fitted kitchen with wall & floor units, granite worktop, granite upstand, granite window sill, tiled flooring, double doors to living room, patio doors to rear garden\r\n\r\nUtility\r\nTiled flooring, worktop, fitted storage, plumbed for appliances\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\nWC, WHB with vanity unit, tiled flooring, tiled splashback\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nCarpeted, hot press, stira to attic\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nFitted wardrobes, timber flooring, en-suite, to rear of property\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\nWC, WHB with vanity unit, large walk in shower unit, rainforest shower, tiled flooring, tiled walls, chrome radiator, LED mirror\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nFitted wardrobes, timber flooring, to front of house\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\nFitted wardrobes, timber flooring, to front of house\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nWC, WHB with vanity unit, large walk in shower unit, rainforest shower, tiled flooring, tiled walls, chrome radiator, LED mirror\r\n\r\nServices: mains water, mains sewage, electricity, gas heating, burglar alarm\r\n\r\nEircode: R93W5P0"
      },
